{"item_uid": "學測93-math-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 93, "year_ce": 2004, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "在坐標空間中給定兩點A(1,2,3)與B(7,6,5)。令S為xy-平面上所有使得向量 P A 垂直於向量\nP B 的P點所成的集合，則\n(1) S為空集合\n(2) S恰含一點\n(3) S恰含兩點\n(4) S為一線段\n(5) S為一圓\n1", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 23.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 17.0, "E": 25.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 42.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 8.0, "E": 32.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 10.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 24.0, "E": 15.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 23.0, "p_high": 42.0, "p_low": 10.0, "discrimination": 32.0, "p_quintiles": [52.0, 24.0, 16.0, 13.0, 9.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測93-math-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 93, "year_ce": 2004, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "設∆ABC為平面上的一個三角形，P 為平面上一點且 A P = A B + t A C ，其中t為一實數。\n3\n試問下列哪一選項為t的最大範圍，使得P落在∆ABC的內部？\n1 1 1 2 3\n(1) 0＜t＜ (2) 0＜t＜ (3) 0＜t＜ (4) 0＜t＜ (5) 0＜t＜\n4 3 2 3 4", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 61.0, "E": 9.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 88.0, "E": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 9.0, "B": 23.0, "C": 22.0, "D": 33.0, "E": 12.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 61.0, "p_high": 88.0, "p_low": 33.0, "discrimination": 55.0, "p_quintiles": [93.0, 78.0, 63.0, 47.0, 25.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測93-math-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 93, "year_ce": 2004, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "台灣證劵交易市場規定股票成交價格只能在前一個交易日的收盤價(即最後一筆的成交價)的\n漲、跌7%範圍內變動。例如：某支股票前一個交易日的收盤價是每股100元，則今天該支股\n票每股的買賣價格必須在93元至107元之間。假設有某支股票的價格起伏很大，某一天的收\n盤價是每股40元，次日起連續五個交易日以跌停板收盤(也就是每天跌7%)，緊接著卻連續\n五個交易日以漲停板收盤(也就是每天漲7%)。請問經過這十個交易日後，該支股票每股的收\n盤價最接近下列哪一個選項中的價格？\n(1)39元 (2) 39.5元 (3) 40元 (4) 40.5元 (5) 41元\n- 2 -\n第3頁 93學年度\n共7頁 數學考科\n貳 、 多 重 選 擇 題", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 26.0, "B": 27.0, "C": 30.0, "D": 9.0, "E": 7.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 42.0, "B": 30.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 6.0, "E": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 9.0, "B": 25.0, "C": 44.0, "D": 12.0, "E": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 26.0, "p_high": 42.0, "p_low": 9.0, "discrimination": 33.0, "p_quintiles": [47.0, 33.0, 26.0, 16.0, 6.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測93-math-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 93, "year_ce": 2004, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "中山高速公路重慶北路交流道南下入口匝道分成內、外兩線車道，路旁立有標誌\n「外側車道 大客車專用」。請選出不違反此規定的選項：\n(1) 小型車行駛內側車道\n(2) 小型車行駛外側車道\n(3) 大客車行駛內側車道\n(4) 大客車行駛外側車道\n(5) 大貨車行駛外側車道", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "F", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 97.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 57.0, "D": 97.0, "E": 40.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 100.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 77.0, "D": 99.0, "E": 22.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 94.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 32.0, "D": 95.0, "E": 62.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 56.0, "p_high": 77.0, "p_low": 30.0, "discrimination": 47.0, "p_quintiles": [81.0, 69.0, 60.0, 45.0, 23.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
